      "question_text": "Sensitivity of 80% and specificity of 90% for disease prevalence 10%. PPV is?",
      "options": {
        "A": "~47%",
        "B": "~89%",
        "C": "~31%",
        "D": "~66%"
      },
      "correct_answer": "A",
      "explanation": "PPV = TP/(TP+FP). With prev 10%: TP=80, FP=90 (10% of 900 = 90), PPV = 80/(80+90) = 47%. PPV increases with higher prevalence. This shows PPV is context-dependent."
